{"verses":[{"id":5932,"verse_number":1,"verse_key":"86:1","text_uthmani":"بِسْمِ ٱللَّهِ ٱلرَّحْمَٰنِ ٱلرَّحِيمِ وَٱلسَّمَآءِ وَٱلطَّارِقِ","transliteration":"Wassamaaa'i wattaariq","translations":[{"text":"By the sky and the night comer -"}]},{"id":5933,"verse_number":2,"verse_key":"86:2","text_uthmani":"وَمَآ أَدْرَىٰكَ مَا ٱلطَّارِقُ","transliteration":"Wa maaa adraaka mattaariq","translations":[{"text":"And what can make you know what is the night comer?"}]},{"id":5934,"verse_number":3,"verse_key":"86:3","text_uthmani":"ٱلنَّجْمُ ٱلثَّاقِبُ","transliteration":"Annajmus saaqib","translations":[{"text":"It is the piercing star -"}]},{"id":5935,"verse_number":4,"verse_key":"86:4","text_uthmani":"إِن كُلُّ نَفْسٍۢ لَّمَّا عَلَيْهَا حَافِظٌۭ","transliteration":"In kullu nafsil lammaa 'alaihaa haafiz","translations":[{"text":"There is no soul but that it has over it a protector."}]},{"id":5936,"verse_number":5,"verse_key":"86:5","text_uthmani":"فَلْيَنظُرِ ٱلْإِنسَٰنُ مِمَّ خُلِقَ","transliteration":"Fal yanzuril insaanu mimma khuliq","translations":[{"text":"So let man observe from what he was created."}]},{"id":5937,"verse_number":6,"verse_key":"86:6","text_uthmani":"خُلِقَ مِن مَّآءٍۢ دَافِقٍۢ","transliteration":"Khuliqa mim maaa'in daafiq","translations":[{"text":"He was created from a fluid, ejected,"}]},{"id":5938,"verse_number":7,"verse_key":"86:7","text_uthmani":"يَخْرُجُ مِنۢ بَيْنِ ٱلصُّلْبِ وَٱلتَّرَآئِبِ","transliteration":"Yakhruju mim bainissulbi wat taraaa'ib","translations":[{"text":"Emerging from between the backbone and the ribs."}]},{"id":5939,"verse_number":8,"verse_key":"86:8","text_uthmani":"إِنَّهُۥ عَلَىٰ رَجْعِهِۦ لَقَادِرٌۭ","transliteration":"Innahoo 'alaa raj'ihee laqaadir","translations":[{"text":"Indeed, Allah, to return him [to life], is Able."}]},{"id":5940,"verse_number":9,"verse_key":"86:9","text_uthmani":"يَوْمَ تُبْلَى ٱلسَّرَآئِرُ","transliteration":"Yawma tublas saraaa'ir","translations":[{"text":"The Day when secrets will be put on trial,"}]},{"id":5941,"verse_number":10,"verse_key":"86:10","text_uthmani":"فَمَا لَهُۥ مِن قُوَّةٍۢ وَلَا نَاصِرٍۢ","transliteration":"Famaa lahoo min quwwatinw wa laa naasir","translations":[{"text":"Then man will have no power or any helper."}]},{"id":5942,"verse_number":11,"verse_key":"86:11","text_uthmani":"وَٱلسَّمَآءِ ذَاتِ ٱلرَّجْعِ","transliteration":"Wassamaaa'i zaatir raj'","translations":[{"text":"By the sky which returns [rain]"}]},{"id":5943,"verse_number":12,"verse_key":"86:12","text_uthmani":"وَٱلْأَرْضِ ذَاتِ ٱلصَّدْعِ","transliteration":"Wal ardi zaatis sad'","translations":[{"text":"And [by] the earth which cracks open,"}]},{"id":5944,"verse_number":13,"verse_key":"86:13","text_uthmani":"إِنَّهُۥ لَقَوْلٌۭ فَصْلٌۭ","transliteration":"Innahoo laqawlun fasl","translations":[{"text":"Indeed, the Qur'an is a decisive statement,"}]},{"id":5945,"verse_number":14,"verse_key":"86:14","text_uthmani":"وَمَا هُوَ بِٱلْهَزْلِ","transliteration":"Wa maa huwa bil hazl","translations":[{"text":"And it is not amusement."}]},{"id":5946,"verse_number":15,"verse_key":"86:15","text_uthmani":"إِنَّهُمْ يَكِيدُونَ كَيْدًۭا","transliteration":"Innahum yakeedoona kaidaa","translations":[{"text":"Indeed, they are planning a plan,"}]},{"id":5947,"verse_number":16,"verse_key":"86:16","text_uthmani":"وَأَكِيدُ كَيْدًۭا","transliteration":"Wa akeedu kaidaa","translations":[{"text":"But I am planning a plan."}]},{"id":5948,"verse_number":17,"verse_key":"86:17","text_uthmani":"فَمَهِّلِ ٱلْكَٰفِرِينَ أَمْهِلْهُمْ رُوَيْدًۢا","transliteration":"Famahhilil kaafireena amhilhum ruwaidaa","translations":[{"text":"So allow time for the disbelievers. Leave them awhile."}]}]}